     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "The health care provider would be expected to check the client’s iron level. Iron deficiency can cause tongue redness and inflammation and pallor. The provider decides to order a complete metabolic panel and vitamin B<sub>12</sub>, iron, and magnesium levels. "
